---

---

<section id="beneficios" class="py-20 bg-gray-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-primary/10 rounded-l-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1/3 h-1/2 bg-primary/5 rounded-r-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:items-center">

      <div class="scroll-animate">
        <span class="text-primary-light font-bold tracking-wider text-sm uppercase">La solución</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 mb-6 leading-tight">
          Tu camino hacia la
          <span class="text-primary-light">independencia</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          La industria de la belleza no solo crece, se transforma. Descubre cómo construir una carrera lucrativa mientras transformas la vida de tus clientes y generas ingresos.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6 mb-10">
          <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary text-sm"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1">Certificación Oficial IDEFT</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Documento con validez curricular en todo México.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary text-sm"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1">Altos Ingresos</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Recupera tu inversión en solo 2-4 meses de trabajo.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary text-sm"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base mb-1">Flexibilidad Total</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Trabaja desde casa, a domicilio o abre tu propia cabina de spa.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <a href="#cursos" class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-primary hover:text-white hover:shadow-glow hover:-translate-y-0.5 transform transition-all duration-300"">
          Ver oferta académica
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 scroll-animate">
        <div class="bg-gray-800/60 backdrop-blur p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
          <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-3xl text-primary mb-2"></i>
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold">200+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Alumnas graduadas</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/60 backdrop-blur p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
          <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow text-3xl text-primary mb-2"></i>
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold">2-4</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Meses para ROI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/60 backdrop-blur p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
          <i class="bi bi-cash-stack text-3xl text-primary mb-2"></i>
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">$15k</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Ingreso promedio</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/60 backdrop-blur p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
          <i class="bi bi-star text-3xl text-primary mb-2"></i>
          <div class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">20+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Años experiencia</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>